---
name: styles
type: registry:style
title: Styles
description: Design tokens with three selectable theme presets (default, secondary, tertiary).
dependencies:
  - tailwindcss
  - tw-animate-css
  - shadcn-svelte
  - "@fontsource-variable/inter"
files:
  - path: registry/items/files/styles/globals.css
    type: registry:file
    target: "~/styles/globals.css"
  - path: registry/items/files/styles/theme.css
    type: registry:file
    target: "~/styles/theme.css"
  - path: registry/items/files/styles/theme-secondary.css
    type: registry:file
    target: "~/styles/theme-secondary.css"
  - path: registry/items/files/styles/theme-tertiary.css
    type: registry:file
    target: "~/styles/theme-tertiary.css"
---

Install the design system CSS foundation, then import it once from your app entry so every component
resolves its color, radius, and font tokens.

```sh
npx shadcn-svelte@latest add @design-system-ui-svelte/styles
```

```ts
import '@/styles/globals.css';
```

This writes `src/styles/globals.css`. If that path already exists, the shadcn CLI prompts before
overwriting it.
